WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.743 --> 00:00:02.853
- [Narrator] In a small
town outside Prague,

00:00:02.853 --> 00:00:04.878
there is a church adorned
with the skeletons

00:00:04.878 --> 00:00:06.810
of at least 40,000 people.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.414
Assembled in the 1800s,

00:00:08.414 --> 00:00:11.257
each burn was stacked
by a single woodcarver.

00:00:11.257 --> 00:00:13.482
The burns are of people
who wanted to be buried

00:00:13.482 --> 00:00:14.700
on holy land.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.929
And this peaceful chapel is
their final resting place.

00:00:17.929 --> 00:00:19.939
This is the Sedlec Ossuary

00:00:19.939 --> 00:00:22.510
also known as The Bone Church.

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:25.177
(gentle music)

